  <!-- § 09 the same state elsewhere. Evergreen; links only -->
  <section>
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="no">09</span><h2>The same state in other guides</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="prose"><p>State figures for prices, jobs, spending and more live in the guides for those measures, each from its own source of record. Every state and union territory also has a profile of its own, drawing them together: <a href="/states/">the state profiles</a>.</p></div>
    <div class="elsewhere">
